ا لحرب شاملة. ليدرك “آرس” أنه يجب عليه أيضًا التحضير من خلال جمع أشخاص موهوبين. وهكذا، المهاجر المضطهد الذي لا يُضاهى في فنون القتال، والفتاة التي كانت عبدة في السابق وتمتلك موهبة سحرية غامضة، والفتى المتردد الذي يشتاق بلا حدود للمعرفة، معا، يقدمون دعمهم ومساعدتهم لـ”آرس” في تحقيق هدفه في إنشاء أقوى إقليم\n\nAfter thirty-five years of perfectly ordinary life, a run-of-the-mill businessman suddenly drops dead...only to be reborn in another world! Now he must live as Ars Louvent, scion of a minor noble family and wielder of a fabulous skill: Appraisal, the power to perceive the strengths and abilities of others at a glance.\n\nHe'll need it, too, because there are plenty of problems to solve in the Louvent family's territory! Ars only has one choice: recruit the most talented individuals his skill can find, and rise up to new heights in his brand new world!","releaseInfo":"2024","imdbRating":"6.0","genres":["مغامرة | Adventure","رسوم متحركة | Animation","خيالي | Fantasy"]},{"id":"3isk_watch__episodes__serie-kardeslerim-mudblij-season-4-episode-85-e942g","type":"series","name":"مسلسل اخوتي 4 مدبلج الحلقة 85","poster":"https://3iskk.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/kardeslerim-mudblij.jpg","posterShape":"poster","background":"https://3iskk.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/kardeslerim-mudblij.jpg","landscapePoster":"https://3iskk.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/kardeslerim-mudblij.jpg","logo":"https://3esk.onl/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/3isk-logo.png","description":"مسلسل اخوتي 4 مدبلج الحلقة 85 — 3isk (قصة عشق)"},{"id":"akwam_series__5768__a-love-other-than-yours","type":"series","name":"A Love Other Than Yours","poster":"https://img.downet.net/thumb/178x260/uploads/PqRSn.webp","posterShape":"poster","background":"https://img.downet.net/thumb/178x260/uploads/PqRSn.webp","landscapePoster":"https://img.downet.net/thumb/178x260/uploads/PqRSn.webp","logo":"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcQ2vuGLv4zY3XpoN2jza2unCQ95xFfypfe-h3k3xteMbGxl7taw-ziXyNg&s=10","descr